[h1]Skate 3 in Gmod[/h1]
Skate 3's real skating in Garry's Mod: its own physics, flick-it tricks, grinds, manuals and bails, running on the community's Skate 3 engine rewrite. Equip the Skateboard and you're standing with the board in hand, exactly like Skate 3. Grind rails are found in any map automatically.

[b]Free forever.[/b] Unofficial fan project, not affiliated with EA or Facepunch.

[h2]What you need[/h2]
[list]
[*]Your own copy of Skate 3 for Xbox 360, as a disc image (.iso). Nothing from the game ships here; the setup app reads what the mod needs from your disc on your own computer.
[*]64-bit Garry's Mod: Steam → Garry's Mod → Properties → Betas → [b]x86-64[/b].
[*]A controller. On Steam Deck / SteamOS, Garry's Mod's controller layout must be a [b]Gamepad[/b] template, not keyboard and mouse.
[/list]

[h2]Install[/h2]
[olist]
[*]Subscribe to this addon.
[*]Download the setup app for Windows or Linux from [url=https://github.com/NotEnxvinity/skate3-gmod/releases]the GitHub releases page[/url]. The Workshop can't carry the skate engine itself, so it comes from there, like G64 does.
[*]Run it and pick your Skate 3 .iso. It finds Garry's Mod, installs the engine, and converts your disc's skater, animations and sounds. Run it again after an update.
[*]Load a map and equip [b]Skateboard[/b] (spawn menu → Weapons → Skate 3).
[/olist]

[h2]Controls[/h2]
Skate 3's own: [b]A[/b] pushes, [b]Y[/b] gets on and off the board, the right stick flicks tricks, triggers grab. [b]D-pad down[/b] drops a session marker, hold [b]D-pad up[/b] to go back to it. Switch weapons to leave skate mode.

[h2]Settings[/h2]
Spawn menu → Utilities → Skate 3: stance (regular or goofy), camera height, sounds (Skate 3's from your disc, or Half-Life 2's), volume, and the trick score's look (minimal on screen, floating beside you, or Half-Life 2 style).

[h2]Known conflicts[/h2]
These addons together leaked memory until the game crashed during testing. If you see "CUtlRBTree overflow", try disabling them:
[list]
[*]First-person body ("Тело от Первого лица")
[*]Source Shadows
[*]InfMap base
[*]LIDAR
[*]Portal Gun (Lua rework)
[/list]

